From: ImpulseROM <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Set auto confirm PIN min digits to 4

SyntheticPasswordManager treats a PIN as auto-confirmable from 6 digits; lower it to 4.
Rebased onto One UI 8.5 DZF3 (register v12 instead of v9).
---
 smali/com/android/server/locksettings/SyntheticPasswordManager.smali | changed
 1 file changed

--- a/smali/com/android/server/locksettings/SyntheticPasswordManager.smali
+++ b/smali/com/android/server/locksettings/SyntheticPasswordManager.smali
@@ -694,7 +694,7 @@
 
     if-eqz v12, :cond_1
 
-    const/4 v12, 0x6
+    const/4 v12, 0x4
 
     if-ge v11, v12, :cond_2
 
-- 
2.43.0

